flowchart Who Gets a Share?

(Haul Counted) -> <Signed the Articles?>
  -no-> (No Share)
  -yes-> <Rank Aboard?>
    -captain-> [Two Shares] -> <Wounded in Action?>
    -quartermaster-> [One and a Half] -> <Wounded in Action?>
    -crew-> [One Share] -> <Wounded in Action?>
    -powder monkey-> [Half Share] -> <Wounded in Action?>
<Wounded in Action?>
  -lost a limb-> [Add Surgeon's Purse] -> (Paid Out)
  -unhurt-> (Paid Out)
  -deserted-> (Forfeit)
